    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0cc099c7c1c69e849ac297",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很好，下次我会把你也打趴的，\n连同那边那个死脑筋一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8877a3c6ba735042d43300b19449cd69709dc98bdceaab20fb22bea684c610f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
