    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70599d5656f3e00e4958f426",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是因为欣赏我清楚表达了\n自己的意见，天狼星象征\n一脸满意地离开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b80622108183dd64951d33f6a598477b8cb004708c87acc93e8a85a4da49ec",
