      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唉，所以我才讨厌\n跟站在管理方那边的人讲话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d1da9556122c7cbf475bedf666d57b8248e7431999d0637e479e59d18c8810",
