      "uid": "zhcn:d6596e7ca314daa009ca0b84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你们可要多多小心，\n别让彼此的立场反过来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82230dce1ab8161e02cb0d0d69f79c75ef79f586a547d70a328d28ed2bbe6172",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
